          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_66" value="&lt;b&gt;How a failure travels&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. A check fails → &lt;b&gt;fail_steps&lt;/b&gt;: Set FailMessage, then a Compose with int(text) throws.&lt;br&gt;2. That stage scope is Failed → later stages Skipped → Main Failed.&lt;br&gt;3. No Terminate inside Main, so &lt;b&gt;Log&lt;/b&gt; always runs and writes the JSON.&lt;br&gt;4. Report_failure ends the run as Failed with FailMessage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Switches&lt;/b&gt; come from the ALMConfig row (one per solution × target). An off switch = stage Succeeded but logged as Skipped." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#C0A000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="990" y="120" width="420" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_67" value="&lt;b&gt;Proven live 2026-09-24&lt;/b&gt; (Demo → TEST)&lt;br&gt;1 all on ✅ · 2 RunImport off ✅&lt;br&gt;3 missing mapping ✅ (stopped before export)&lt;br&gt;4 variable only ✅ · 5 regression ✅ (Import 67 s)&lt;br&gt;6 child failure ✅" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#C0A000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="990" y="370" width="420" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
