        <mxCell id="p6_42" value="&lt;b&gt;What C3 guarantees&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Every reference is bound to the connection in ALMConnections.&lt;br&gt;2. Every variable value equals ALMVariables (can run without an import: RunImport off + RunPostImport on).&lt;br&gt;3. Solution cloud flows are turned on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Proven live&lt;/b&gt;: test 4 (variable only) and test 6 (wrong ConnectionId → C3 replied Failed, C1 logged PostImport Failed)." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#C0A000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
