        <mxCell id="p7_32" value="&lt;b&gt;Why this order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. C5 before Export/Import: the TEST Products list must exist so its ID can go into dev_ProductsList before C2 imports.&lt;br&gt;2. C6 before C4: C4 needs a group to share the app with.&lt;br&gt;3. Each child replies status + message like C2/C3, and C1 logs it as its own stage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Open decisions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;· C5: how to describe lists as config (schema file in repo vs SharePoint list)?&lt;br&gt;· C6: who owns group membership - pipeline or IT?&lt;br&gt;· C4: create the Power Apps for Admins connection (kriall076 → service account)." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#C0A000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
